msgstr "Tafuta Hapa"
msgid "Click this button to initiate a search for the string you have entered to the left\nand highlight the matches, starting at the top-left corner of the screen.\n\nClick the '?' to get more info."
msgstr "Bofya kitufe hiki ili uanzishe utafutaji wa mfuatano ulioweka upande wa kushoto\na uangazie zinazolingana, kuanzia kona ya juu kushoto ya skrini.\n\nBofya '?' kupata habari zaidi."
