msgid "Just Display Everything!"
msgstr "Onyesha Kila Kitu Tu!"
msgid "Checks all of the below checkboxes except for 'twisty' and sets the display level to the maximum detail level."
msgstr "Hukagua visanduku vya kuteua vilivyo hapa chini isipokuwa kwa 'twisty' na kuweka kiwango cha onyesho hadi kiwango cha juu zaidi cha maelezo."
msgid "Display Profile and Task Action Conditions"
msgstr "Onyesha Wasifu na Masharti ya Kitendo cha Kazi"
msgid "Display the conditions such as 'State', 'Event', 'Time', etc. in the output."
msgstr "Onyesha masharti kama vile 'Jimbo', 'Tukio', 'Saa', n.k. katika towe."
msgid "Display TaskerNet Info"
msgstr "Onyesha Maelezo ya TaskerNet"
msgid "Include the Tasker 'preferences' in the output, if available in the XML file."
msgstr "Jumuisha 'mapendeleo' ya Tasker katika towe, ikiwa inapatikana katika faili ya XML."
msgid "Display a directory of all Projects, Profiles, Tasks and Scenes with hotlinks at the beginning of the output."
msgstr "Onyesha saraka ya Miradi, Wasifu, Majukumu na Maonyesho yote yenye viungo vya mawasiliano mwanzoni mwa matokeo."
msgid "Display a diagram of the configuration with all Task connections your the default text editor.\nThis option only relates to the 'Run and Exit' and 'ReRun' buttons."
msgstr "Onyesha mchoro wa usanidi wenye miunganisho yote ya Task, kihariri chako cha maandishi chaguomsingi.\nChaguo hili linahusiana tu na vitufe vya 'Run and Out' na 'ReRun'."
msgid "Display Prettier Output"
msgstr "Onyesha Toleo Mzuri Zaidi"
msgid "Align all Task action arguments and parameters for nicer output."
msgstr "Pangilia hoja zote za Task action na vigezo kwa matokeo mazuri zaidi."
msgid "Project/Profile/Task/Scene Names:"
msgstr "Majina ya Mradi/Wasifu/Kazi/Maeneo:"
msgid "Add highlighting to Project, Profile and Task names in the output."
msgstr "Ongeza kuangazia kwa Mradi, Wasifu na Majina ya Kazi kwenye pato."
msgid "Bold"
msgstr "Ujasiri"
msgid "Bold and Italicize are mutually exclusive in the Map view."
msgstr "Bold na Italicize ni za kipekee katika mwonekano wa Ramani."
msgid "Italicize"
msgstr "Italicize"
msgid "Italicize and Bold are mutually exclusive in the Map view."
msgstr "Italicize na Bold ni za kipekee katika mwonekano wa Ramani."
msgid "Highlight"
msgstr "Angazia"
msgid "Underline"
msgstr "Piga mstari"
msgid "Select how many actions in a Task before issuing a warning.\nThe warning appears near th4e bottom of the configuration output,\nand is intended to help identify Tasks that are too comple\nand which should potentially be broken up into multiple Tasks.\nA setting of '100' means there is no limit."
msgstr "Chagua ni vitendo vingapi katika Jukumu kabla ya kutoa ilani.\nOnyo huonekana karibu na sehemu ya chini ya pato la usanidi,\na inakusudiwa kusaidia kutambua Majukumu ambayo yamekamilika sana\na ambayo yanaweza kugawanywa katika Majukumu mengi.\nMpangilio wa '100' unamaanisha kuwa hakuna kikomo."
msgid "Creates the If/Then/Else indentation options."
msgstr "Huunda chaguo za ujongezaji Kama/Kisha/Vingine."
msgid "If/Then/Else Indentation Amount:"
msgstr "Ikiwa/Kisha/Vinginevyo Kiasi cha Ujongezaji:"
msgid "Set the indentation amount for If/Then/Else blocks.\n\nThe default is '4'."
msgstr "Weka kiasi cha ujongezaji kwa vizuizi vya If/Basi/Vingine.\n\nChaguo-msingi ni '4'."
msgid "Creates the language selection dropdown."
msgstr "Huunda menyu kunjuzi ya uteuzi wa lugha."
msgid "Language:"
msgstr "Lugha:"
msgid "Creates the appearance mode selection."
msgstr "Huunda uteuzi wa hali ya mwonekano."
msgid "Appearance Mode:"
msgstr "Hali ya Mwonekano:"
msgid "Light"
msgstr "Mwanga"
msgid "Dark"
msgstr "Giza"
msgid "System"
msgstr "Mfumo"
msgid "Creates buttons for different views (Map, Diagram, Tree)."
msgstr "Huunda vitufe vya maoni tofauti (Ramani, Mchoro, Mti)."
msgid "Views"
msgstr "Maoni"
msgid "Show a detailed view of your configuration, with connections between tasks.\n\nThis is identical to the 'ReRun' button, but the output is displayed inside another window rather than in a browser."
msgstr "Onyesha mwonekano wa kina wa usanidi wako, wenye miunganisho kati ya kazi.\n\nHii ni sawa na kitufe cha 'ReRun', lakini towe huonyeshwa ndani ya dirisha lingine badala ya kwenye kivinjari."
msgid "Show a diagrammatic view of your configuration, with connections between tasks.\n\nThis is identical to the 'ReRun' button combined with the 'Display Configuration Outline' checkbox selected,\nbut the output is displayed inside another window rather than in a text editor."
msgstr "Onyesha mwonekano wa mchoro wa usanidi wako, wenye miunganisho kati ya kazi.\n\nHii ni sawa na kitufe cha 'Run Run' pamoja na kisanduku cha kuteua cha 'Onyesha Muhtasari wa Usanidi' kilichochaguliwa,\nlakini towe huonyeshwa ndani ya dirisha lingine badala ya katika kihariri cha maandishi."
msgid "Show a simple hierarchical tree view of your configuration."
msgstr "Onyesha mwonekano rahisi wa mti wa daraja la usanidi wako."
msgid "Creates the view limit dropdown."
msgstr "Huunda menyu kunjuzi ya kikomo cha kutazama."
msgid "View Limit:"
msgstr "Kikomo cha Kutazama:"
msgid "Unlimited"
msgstr "Bila kikomo"
msgid "Select the maximum number of items to display in the view to be allowed.\n\nAnything over this amount will stop the generation of the view as a means to throttle the program.\n\nNote: This is only for the 'Map' and 'Diagram' views, not the tree view."
msgstr "Chagua idadi ya juu zaidi ya vipengee vya kuonyesha katika mwonekano unaoruhusiwa.\n\nChochote kinachozidi kiasi hiki kitasimamisha uundaji wa mwonekano kama njia ya kusukuma programu.\n\nKumbuka: Hii ni kwa ajili ya 'Ramani' na 'Mchoro' tu, wala si mwonekano wa mti."
msgid "Reset Options"
msgstr "Weka upya Chaguo"
msgid "Reset all of the options to their default values, including colors, font used, and other settings.\n\nThe currently loaded XML will be cleared out."
msgstr "Weka upya chaguo zote ziwe thamani zake chaguomsingi, ikijumuisha rangi, fonti iliyotumika na mipangilio mingineyo.\n\nXML iliyopakiwa kwa sasa itafutwa."
msgid "Save Settings"
msgstr "Hifadhi Mipangilio"
msgid "Restore Settings"
msgstr "Rejesha Mipangilio"
msgid "Report Issue"
msgstr "Ripoti Suala"
msgid "Report any issues and/or suggestions to the developer.\n\nThis will open a browser window to the GitHub Issues page, and you will need a GitHub account to submit an issue."
msgstr "Ripoti matatizo na/au mapendekezo yoyote kwa msanidi.\n\nHii itafungua dirisha la kivinjari kwenye ukurasa wa Masuala ya GitHub, na utahitaji akaunti ya GitHub ili kuwasilisha suala."
msgid "Font To Use In Output:"
msgstr "Fonti ya Kutumia Katika Pato:"
msgid "This is a list of all of the monospaced fonts available on your system.\n\nThe font selected will be used in all output.\n\n'Courier' or 'Courier New' is highly recommended for Diagrams to ensure proper connector alignment."
msgstr "Hii ni orodha ya fonti zote zenye nafasi moja zinazopatikana kwenye mfumo wako.\n\nFonti iliyochaguliwa itatumika katika matokeo yote.\n\n'Courier' au 'Courier New' inapendekezwa sana kwa Michoro ili kuhakikisha upatanishaji sahihi wa kiunganishi."
msgid "Clear Messages"
msgstr "Futa Ujumbe"
msgid "Get XML from Android Device"
msgstr "Pata XML kutoka kwa Kifaa cha Android"
msgid "Fetch XML from an Android device.\n\nClick on the 'Get Android Help' button for more info."
msgstr "Leta XML kutoka kifaa cha Android.\n\nBofya kitufe cha 'Pata Usaidizi wa Android' kwa maelezo zaidi."
msgid "Get Local XML"
msgstr "Pata XML ya Karibu"
msgid "Fetch XML from a local drive on this computer.\n\nThe XML fetched will become the current source for MapTasker commands."
msgstr "Leta XML kutoka kwa hifadhi ya ndani kwenye kompyuta hii.\n\nXML iliyoletwa itakuwa chanzo cha sasa cha amri za MapTasker."
msgid "Display Help"
msgstr "Usaidizi wa Kuonyesha"
msgid "Get Android Help"
msgstr "Pata Usaidizi wa Android"
msgid "Browser Options"
msgstr "Chaguzi za Kivinjari"
msgid "Run and Exit"
msgstr "Kimbia na Utoke"
msgid "Generate a map of the current XML, save the results as an html file and display the map in the default browser.\n\nThe program terminates when done."
msgstr "Tengeneza ramani ya XML ya sasa, hifadhi matokeo kama faili ya html na uonyeshe ramani katika kivinjari chaguo-msingi.\n\nProgramu itakoma ikikamilika."
msgid "ReRun"
msgstr "Run Rudia"
msgid "Same as the 'Run and Exit' button,\nbut the program restarts after displaying the browser output."
msgstr "Sawa na kitufe cha 'Endesha na Uondoke',\nlakini programu inaanza tena baada ya kuonyesha towe la kivinjari."
msgid "Exit"
msgstr "Utgång"
msgid "(Pick ONLY One)"
msgstr "(Chagua Moja TU)"
msgid "Select either a single Project, Profile, or Task to display (Map and Diagram views, and browser).\nIf a single Project is selected, all of it's Projects, Tasks and Scenes will be included.\nIf a single Profile is selected, it and all of its Tasks will be displayed."
msgstr "Chagua ama Mradi, Wasifu, au Jukumu la kuonyesha (Mionekano ya Ramani na Mchoro na kivinjari).\nMradi mmoja ukichaguliwa, Miradi, Majukumu na Mandhari yake yote yatajumuishwa.\nIkiwa Wasifu mmoja utachaguliwa, Mradi huo na Majukumu yake yote yataonyeshwa."
msgid "List Unnamed Items"
msgstr "Orodhesha Vipengee Visivyotajwa"
msgid "'List Unnamed Items' checkbox"
msgstr "Kisanduku cha kuteua cha 'Orodhesha Vipengee Visivyo na Jina'"
msgid "Check this if you want to see unnamed Profiles and Tasks in the\npulldown lists (above) and in the optional directory.\n\nLeaving this unchecked will leave unnamed Tasks and Profiles\nout of the pulldown lists and out of the directory,\nbut the unnamed Profile and Task details will still appear in the output."
msgstr "Angalia hili ikiwa ungependa kuona Wasifu na Majukumu yasiyo na majina katika\norodha za kubomoa (hapo juu) na katika saraka ya hiari.\n\nKuacha kipengele hiki bila kuteua kutaacha Majukumu na Wasifu zisizo na majina\nnje ya orodha za kubomoa na kutoka kwenye saraka,\nlakini maelezo ya Wasifu na Kazi ambayo hayajatajwa bado yataonekana kwenye towe."
