msgid "Display an extended list of ALL available models.\n\nNote: If the API key is not set for OpenAI or Gemini,\nthen the default model list for the respective\nAI provider will be displayed.\n\nNote: Not all models have been validated and\none or more may return an error on analysis."
msgstr "Onyesha orodha iliyopanuliwa ya miundo YOTE inayopatikana.\n\nKumbuka: Ikiwa ufunguo wa API haujawekwa kwa OpenAI au Gemini,\basi orodha chaguo-msingi ya mtoa huduma\nAI itaonyeshwa.\n\nKumbuka: Sio miundo yote iliyoidhinishwa na\hakuna au zaidi inayoweza kurejesha hitilafu kwenye uchanganuzi."
